@page "/"

<PageTitle>Evan Yeager - Home</PageTitle>

<div class="container home-container">
    <div class="profile-section window">
        <div class="window-body">
            <img src="files/webheadshot.JPG" alt="Evan Yeager" class="profile-image" fetchpriority="high" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bio-section window">
        <div class="title-bar">
            <div class="title-bar-text">About</div>
        </div>
        <div class="window-body">
            <h1>Evan Yeager</h1>
            <p>Berkeley EECS undergrad</p>
            <p>Current co-pres for <a href="https://poker.berkeley.edu" target="_blank">Poker at Berkeley</a></p>
            <p>I experience dunning-kreuger on an hourly basis</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-section window">
        <div class="title-bar">
            <div class="title-bar-text">Contact</div>
        </div>
        <div class="window-body">
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:yeager@berkeley.edu">yeager@berkeley.edu</a></li>
                <li><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/evanyeager" target="_blank">in</a></li>
                <li><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/yeager620" target="_blank">yeager620</a></li>
                <li><strong>HuggingFace:</strong> <a href="https://huggingface.co/totalorganfailure" target="_blank">totalorganfailure</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="technical-writing-section window">
    <div class="title-bar">
        <div class="title-bar-text">Some Awards</div>
    </div>
    <div class="window-body">
        <div class="writing-list">

            <div class="window writing-item-window">
                <div class="title-bar">
                    <div class="title-bar-text">MathCON Finals Honorable Mention</div>
                </div>
                <div class="window-body">
                    <p>Was an honorable mention at MathCON Finals 2022; 
                    stats for the competition on a per-award basis weren't published (or at least in any interpretable form) 
                    but based on total participants, total number of grade levels participating, 
                    and number of people who got honorable mention or higher that year, I estimate that I was within the Top 12 out of ~3000 other Juniors, i.e. Top 0.4%</p>

                    <div class="button-group">
                        <button class="win98-button" @onclick="() => ToggleMathConPreview()">
                            @(ShowMathConPreview ? "Hide" : "Medal")
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    @if (ShowMathConPreview)
                        {
                            <div class="image-preview">
                                <img src="files/mathcon_medal.png"
                                    alt="MathCON medal"
                                    class="inline-preview-img"
                                    loading="lazy" />
                            </div>
                        }
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="window writing-item-window">
                <div class="title-bar">
                    <div class="title-bar-text">Top 3 Paper / Featured Researcher: CPS Capstone Journal</div>
                </div>
                <div class="window-body">
                    <p>Was published in a journal for research done by highschool students in CPS, selected as one of the top 3 papers in 2023</p>
                    <p>Journal: <a href="https://sites.google.com/cps.edu/journalofcpscapstoneresearch/home?authuser=0" target="_blank">The Chicago Public School's Journal of AP Capstone Research</a></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="technical-writing-section window">
    <div class="title-bar">
        <div class="title-bar-text">Some of my technical writing and notes</div>
    </div>
    <div class="window-body">
        <div class="writing-list">
            <div class="window writing-item-window">
                <div class="title-bar">
                    <div class="title-bar-text">Generalized Kelly Criterion</div>
                </div>
                <div class="window-body">
                    <p>A technical note from one of my projects on MLB game prediction and betting model development since I needed to determine an optimal strategy for certain types of bets with outcomes that could result in a tie. </p>

                    <div class="button-group">
                        <button class="win98-button" @onclick="() => ToggleKellyPreview()">
                            <span class="writing-icon">📄</span>
                            @(ShowKellyPreview ? "Hide Preview" : "Show Preview")
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    @if (ShowKellyPreview)
                    {
                        <div class="writing-preview">
                            <iframe src="files/Generalized_Kelly.pdf"
                                    width="100%"
                                    height="600"
                                    class="inline-preview">
                            </iframe>
                        </div>
                    }
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="window writing-item-window">
                <div class="title-bar">
                    <div class="title-bar-text">Electromyographic Analysis of Row Exercises</div>
                </div>
                <div class="window-body">
                    <p>A comparative analysis of muscle activation patterns across different rowing exercise variations using surface electromyography</p>

                    <div class="button-group">
                        <button class="win98-button" @onclick="() => ToggleEmgPreview()">
                            <span class="writing-icon">📄</span>
                            @(ShowEmgPreview ? "Hide Preview" : "Show Preview")
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    @if (ShowEmgPreview)
                    {
                        <div class="writing-preview">
                            <iframe src="files/emg.pdf"
                                    width="100%"
                                    height="600"
                                    class="inline-preview">
                            </iframe>
                        </div>
                    }
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .image-preview {
        max-width: 280px;
    }

    .inline-preview-img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;
    }

    .technical-writing-section {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        max-width: none;
        width: 100%;
    }

    .writing-list {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .writing-item-window {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .button-group {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .win98-button {
        padding: 2px 8px;
        font-family: "MS Sans Serif", Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 12px;
        background: #c0c0c0;
        color: #000;
        border: 2px solid;
        border-color: #dfdfdf #000 #000 #dfdfdf;
        box-shadow: 1px 1px #000;
        position: relative;
        cursor: pointer;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 4px;
    }

    .win98-button:active {
        border-color: #000 #dfdfdf #dfdfdf #000;
        box-shadow: -1px -1px #000;
    }

    .writing-icon {
        font-size: 12px;
        line-height: 1;
    }

    .writing-preview {
        margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .inline-preview {
        width: 100%;
        height: 600px;
        border: 2px solid;
        border-color: #000 #dfdfdf #dfdfdf #000;
        background: white;
    }
</style>

@code {
    private bool ShowKellyPreview { get; set; } = false;
    private bool ShowMathConPreview { get; set; } = false;
    private bool ShowEmgPreview { get; set; } = false;

    private void ToggleMathConPreview()
    {
        ShowMathConPreview = !ShowMathConPreview;
    }

    private void ToggleKellyPreview()
    {
        ShowKellyPreview = !ShowKellyPreview;
    }

    private void ToggleEmgPreview()
    {
        ShowEmgPreview = !ShowEmgPreview;
    }
}

